Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:20.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's trapped in an ATM vestibule with Jill Goodacre.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:20.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他被困在提款机的门廊 跟吉儿古德克在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.34,0:05:23.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.34,0:05:23.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德，听着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.43,0:05:30.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, like that thought never entered my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.43,0:05:30.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别以为我没那种念头
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.81,0:05:35.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL: Come on, somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.81,0:05:35.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.36,0:05:36.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: I'll go. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.36,0:05:36.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}轮到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.90,0:05:41.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, um, senior year of college, on a pool table.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.90,0:05:41.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大四那年在撞球台上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.32,0:05:42.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}JOEY: Ooh. - Pool table?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.32,0:05:42.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}撞球台
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:44.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:44.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是我的好妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.99,0:05:49.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, okay. My weirdest place would have to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.99,0:05:49.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我最奇怪的地点是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:54.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the women's room on the second floor of the New York City Public Library.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:54.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}纽约市立图书馆二楼的女厕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:57.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. What were you doing in a library?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:57.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊，你去图书馆做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.84,0:06:03.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Pheebs, what about you? - Oh, um, Milwaukee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.84,0:06:03.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比 你呢 密尔瓦基
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:09.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:09.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.35,0:06:14.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Disneyland, 1989. "It's a small world after all."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.35,0:06:14.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一九八九年迪士尼乐园  “小小世界”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:18.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:18.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:20.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The, uh, ride broke down...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:20.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}游乐设施坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.23,0:06:24.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so Carol and I went behind a couple of those mechanical Dutch children.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.23,0:06:24.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卡萝跟我躲在 机器荷兰小孩后面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.82,0:06:30.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They fixed the ride, and we were asked never to return to the Magic Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.82,0:06:30.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们修好游乐设备后 要我们永远别回魔法王国
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.16,0:06:32.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh. Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.16,0:06:32.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.79,0:06:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I already went.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.79,0:06:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}少来，我已经说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.25,0:06:36.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You did not go. - Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.25,0:06:36.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 才没有 - 我说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:37.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: Tell us. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:37.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.09,0:06:42.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, uh, the weirdest place would have to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.09,0:06:42.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，我最奇怪的地点是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.47,0:06:47.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the foot of the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.47,0:06:47.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}床脚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Step back. - We have a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不会吧  - 冠军已经出炉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:02.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've never had a relationship with that kind of passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:02.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我从没有过那么激情的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.32,0:07:06.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where you have to have somebody right there in the middle of a theme park.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.32,0:07:06.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一定要在游乐园跟某人做爱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:12.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was the only thing to do there that didn't have a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:12.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是那里唯一不必排队的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.71,0:07:18.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, Barry wouldn't even kiss me on a miniature-golf course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.71,0:07:18.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}巴瑞连在迷你高尔夫球场 都不愿意吻我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.96,0:07:20.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Come on. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.96,0:07:20.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 少来了 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.34,0:07:22.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He said we were holding up the people behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.34,0:07:22.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说我们会挡到后面的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:25.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you didn't marry him because?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没有嫁给他是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.68,0:07:31.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think there are people that go through life...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.68,0:07:31.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得有人终其一生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.51,0:07:33.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...never having that kind of?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.51,0:07:33.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都不会有那种…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:35.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Probably. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:35.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 或许吧 - 真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.02,0:07:39.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll tell you something. Passion is way overrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.02,0:07:39.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我得告诉你一件事 大家都太高估激情了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:41.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah, right. - It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:41.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 对 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.73,0:07:43.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Eventually, it kind of burns out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.73,0:07:43.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最后激情会褪去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.23,0:07:49.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But hopefully what you're left with is trust and security and, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.23,0:07:49.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你希望留下信任跟安全咸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:51.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In my ex-wife's case, lesbianism.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:51.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我前妻则是成了女同志
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:08:00.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For all those people who miss out on that, uh, passion thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:08:00.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对错过激情的人来说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:02.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...there's other good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:02.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是件好事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.46,0:08:05.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.46,0:08:05.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.01,0:08:07.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, um, I don't think that'll be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.01,0:08:07.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不相信那种事会发生在你身上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.93,0:08:10.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You don't? - Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.93,0:08:10.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.39,0:08:12.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, I see, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.39,0:08:12.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:14.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...big passion in your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:14.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}未来你会有段非常激情的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.06,0:08:16.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Really? - Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.06,0:08:16.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.81,0:08:18.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You do? - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.81,0:08:18.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你那么认为  - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.94,0:08:20.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, you're so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.94,0:08:20.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯，你真的是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:29.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:29.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:33.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's never gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:33.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:42.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - You and Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:42.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么  - 你跟瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.01,0:08:53.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.01,0:08:53.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.22,0:08:57.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because you waited too long to make your move...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.22,0:08:57.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你迟迟不肯展开行动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:09:00.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and now you're in the "Friend Zone."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:09:00.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在你们进入〝朋友区〞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:03.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no. I'm not in the Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:03.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，我不在那一区
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.15,0:09:06.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, Ross. You're mayor of the Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.15,0:09:06.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯，你还是区长呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.15,0:09:10.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I'm taking my time, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.15,0:09:10.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是在慢慢来，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:12.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm laying the groundwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:12.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在打基础
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:15.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every day I get a little bit closer to, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:15.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，每天我越来越靠近…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.74,0:09:16.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Priesthood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.74,0:09:16.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}成为神父的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:22.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, I'm telling you, she has no idea what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:22.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得告诉你 她不知道你在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.71,0:09:26.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you don't ask her out soon, you'll end up stuck in the Zone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.71,0:09:26.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你不快约她出去 你们会永远只能做朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.21,0:09:28.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I will, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.21,0:09:28.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会的  我只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:31.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm waiting for the, uh, right moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:31.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在等时机成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.97,0:09:35.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.97,0:09:35.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.93,0:09:38.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What, now? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.93,0:09:38.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 现在  - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.85,0:09:41.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's messing you up? The wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.85,0:09:41.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得哪里不对劲  美酒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.44,0:09:44.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The candles? The moonlight? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.44,0:09:44.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蜡烛 月光
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.40,0:09:47.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You gotta go up to her and say, "Look, Rachel, I think..."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.40,0:09:47.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你只需要走过去跟她说 〝瑞秋，我…〞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:49.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Shh! - Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:49.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘘  - 嘘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:51.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What are we shushing? - We're shushing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:51.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么  - 我们会嘘个不停
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:55.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because we're trying to hear something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:55.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是因为我们想听见声音
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.78,0:09:59.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - Uh, don't you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.78,0:09:59.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么声音  你没听到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:03.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:03.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:05.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- See? - Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:05.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:13.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Would you like some gum? - Oh. Is it sugarless?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:13.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你要吃口香糖吗 - 是无糖的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:18.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Uh, sorry, it's not. - Then, no, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:18.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 抱歉，不是 - 不用了，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:20.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHANDLER [THINKING]: What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:20.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是怎么一回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.14,0:10:26.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mental note: If Jill Goodacre offers you gum, you take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.14,0:10:26.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别忘了，吉儿古德克请你吃口香糖 一定要接受
