Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.14,0:15:58.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，我是说今晚他是从哪里 突然进入我们的生活里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:03.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The cat turned out to be Paolo's cat. Isn't that funny?
